  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - Gaza - Protection</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - Gaza - Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA will continue scaling up protection monitoring through focal points in each Agency-managed shelter, with identified cases supported via its case management system. The Agency will distribute protection NFIs, including dignity kits, baby hygiene kits, diapers, seasonal clothing and assistive devices, and deliver explosive ordnance risk education sessions, especially for children. To promote social cohesion, UNRWA will run community radio programming on protection issues and reinforce its PSEA mechanisms, with special attention to specific protection cases, including released detainees.</narrative>
